TEXT 64 896 Left 2 !.tran 0 50m 0 10u
TEXT 64 936 Left 2 ;Complete 6-Bit Segmented DAC System\nVoltage Regulator: Simplified representation generating VDD and biases\nDAC Core: 7 thermometer units + 4 binary units\nOpAmp: Initially modeled as ideal VCVS with gain=10^6\nDigital inputs: D1,D2,D3 (MSBs) and B3,B4,B5,B6 (LSBs)\nOutput: VOUT with LSB=12.5mV, Full-scale≈787.5mV
TEXT 64 1072 Left 2 ;To use full circuits:\n1. Replace simplified voltage regulator with complete circuit from Voltage_Regulator.asc\n2. Replace E_OpAmp with complete OpAmp from OpAmp_Folded_Cascode.asc\n3. Expand DAC switching network to include all M50-M94 from DAC_Core.asc
